                <pb facs="0653" n="581" sameAs="frus:frus1909/pg581"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 10044/167.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Leishman
                        to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Pera</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1909-04-27"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">April 27, 1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Leishman says the Sultan has been dethroned, and that his brother, Rechad,
                    who will reign under the name of Mohammed Fifth, has been placed on the
                    throne.</p>
            </div>
